   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-f671a2bce128",
    "ev-4081415f77fb",
    "ev-03f01a29eb0b"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "ruled_out": [
  {
   "statement": "A latency/timeout cascade is unlikely. No p95 latency onset was detected on any service, and p95 stays low (inventory max 47ms, orders max 99ms, gateway max 140ms). The failures are fast errors, not timeouts.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-4081415f77fb",
    "ev-e960c3ed491b",
    "ev-03f01a29eb0b"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "Gateway and orders are unlikely to be the origin. Their errors explicitly cite a downstream failure (orders 502 and inventory 500 respectively).",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-bf38338a2a0a",
    "ev-668d724aaa57"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "unknowns": [
  "Which peer is resetting inventory's connections (e.g. a database, cache or other dependency)? There is no evidence for any inventory dependency in the snapshot.",
  "Trace collection failed, so span-level attribution and self-time for the example traces are unavailable.",
  "No deployment or config-change records are in the snapshot. A recent change to inventory (release 3.1.5) or to its dependency can be neither confirmed nor ruled out.",
  "Infrastructure signals for inventory (pod restarts, connection pool metrics, network errors) are not included."
 ],
 "recommended_actions": [
  {
   "action": "Re-run the trace query for the incident window, starting with example traces 96b56f065ccbfcabc554ab013d50c263, b740f27878e327ad556818c07b9fb6cb and 96e65068ba2264a0415be4e7e241a314.",
   "rationale": "Traces would show which downstream span from inventory fails with the connection reset, identifying the peer.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "src-traces",
    "ev-f671a2bce128"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Inspect inventory logs around the 'connection reset by peer' errors for the target host/port, and check the health of inventory's dependencies (DB/cache) from 08:19Z.",
   "rationale": "Inventory is the deepest service failing and its error points to a peer closing connections.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-f671a2bce128",
    "ev-4081415f77fb"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Check deploy and config history for inventory (release 3.1.5) and its dependencies shortly before 08:19:37Z, and roll back if a change lines up.",
   "rationale": "An abrupt onset across the chain is consistent with a change, but no deployment records were provided to confirm or exclude one.",
   "evidence_ids": [
